  "openQuestions": [
    "Day and night toggle: Figma shows it on every page but no behaviour is specified. Built as two links with is-active on day; no script.",
    "Book now URL: no booking engine link yet; Book link prop defaults to #book.",
    "experiences has no matching page yet; linked to /arts until a happenings or experiences page exists.",
    "Shield-Dark and Shield-Light variants (236:8363, 236:8498) exist in the Figma set but no page uses them; not built."
  ],
  "deviations": [
    "Menu list is a div of links, not ul > li, to avoid the List builder seeding empty items (Q013) and so navToggle fades the links directly.",
    "Day and night switch is hidden below 992px (no room beside the logo); move into the menu later if wanted.",
    "Menu open state, transition and the open colour override sit in an HtmlEmbed <style>, because Webflow classes cannot express descendant selectors on .is-nav-open.",
    "Day and night controls are divs with role=button and tabindex, not href=# links, so a click never jumps the page; there is no native button through the Data API (Q015)."
  ],
